<p>The <b>placeables.xls</b> file contains the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> data that define every placeables' appearance, properties and interactions. These 2da files are used by the Toolset, in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Placeable%20editor" title="Placeable editor (page does not exist)">Placeable editor</a>, and by the game engine.
